            <title>1.1.0</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 00:25:18 +0100</pubDate>
            <link>https://padrail.xyz</link>
            <sparkle:version>2</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Padrail 1.1</h3>
<ul>
  <li>A stronger double tick at 0%, at 100% and at your favorite volume. Vibration can be off, only at the limits, or at every step.</li>
  <li>The edges ignore you while you hold a click, and you can pause Padrail in specific apps from the menu.</li>
  <li>Brightness works on the screen your pointer is on, external monitors included.</li>
  <li>An optional volume limit for headphones and AirPods.</li>
  <li>A Magic Trackpad connected after launch now works right away.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
